{"page":381,"verses":[{"verse_key":"27:45","surah":27,"ayah":45,"ar_uthmani":"وَلَقَدْ أَرْسَلْنَآ إِلَىٰ ثَمُودَ أَخَاهُمْ صَـٰلِحًا أَنِ ٱعْبُدُوا۟ ٱللَّهَ فَإِذَا هُمْ فَرِيقَانِ يَخْتَصِمُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"To the people of Thamud We sent their brother, Salih, saying, ‘Worship God alone,’ but they split into two rival factions.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَلَقَدْ","en_gloss":"And certainly","transliteration":"walaqad","verse_key":"27:45"},{"pos":2,"ar":"أَرْسَلْنَآ","en_gloss":"We sent","transliteration":"arsalnā","verse_key":"27:45"},{"pos":3,"ar":"إِلَىٰ","en_gloss":"to","transliteration":"ilā","verse_key":"27:45"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ثَمُودَ","en_gloss":"Thamud","transliteration":"thamūda","verse_key":"27:45"},{"pos":5,"ar":"أَخَاهُمْ","en_gloss":"their brother","transliteration":"akhāhum","verse_key":"27:45"},{"pos":6,"ar":"صَـٰلِحًا","en_gloss":"Salih","transliteration":"ṣāliḥan","verse_key":"27:45"},{"pos":7,"ar":"أَنِ","en_gloss":"that","transliteration":"ani","verse_key":"27:45"},{"pos":8,"ar":"ٱعْبُدُوا۟","en_gloss":"Worship","transliteration":"uʿ'budū","verse_key":"27:45"},{"pos":9,"ar":"ٱللَّهَ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-laha","verse_key":"27:45"},{"pos":10,"ar":"فَإِذَا","en_gloss":"Then behold","transliteration":"fa-idhā","verse_key":"27:45"},{"pos":11,"ar":"هُمْ","en_gloss":"They","transliteration":"hum","verse_key":"27:45"},{"pos":12,"ar":"فَرِيقَانِ","en_gloss":"(became) two parties","transliteration":"farīqāni","verse_key":"27:45"},{"pos":13,"ar":"يَخْتَصِمُونَ","en_gloss":"quarreling","transliteration":"yakhtaṣimūna","verse_key":"27:45"},{"pos":14,"ar":"٤٥","en_gloss":"(45)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"27:45"}]},{"verse_key":"27:46","surah":27,"ayah":46,"ar_uthmani":"قَالَ يَـٰقَوْمِ لِمَ تَسْتَعْجِلُونَ بِٱلسَّيِّئَةِ قَبْلَ ٱلْحَسَنَةِ ۖ لَوْلَا تَسْتَغْفِرُونَ ٱللَّهَ لَعَلَّكُمْ تُرْحَمُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Salih said, ‘My people, why do you rush to bring [forward] what is bad rather than good? Why